    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h1&gt;Letta Server 0.16.7 Release Notes&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;173 commits since 0.16.6&lt;/strong&gt; | Released March 31, 2026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self-hosted users: this is a big upgrade.&lt;/strong&gt; The default global context window is raised from 32k to 128k, the context window reset bug (LET-7991) is fixed, and compaction has been overhauled. If you've been running curl commands to patch your c</ns0:content>
