    <ns0:title>v0.16.6</ns0:title>
    <ns0:content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;Highlights&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expanded Conversations API support for &lt;strong&gt;default conversation / agent-direct mode&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New conversations now initialize with a &lt;strong&gt;compiled system message at creation time&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;model_settings.max_output_tokens&lt;/code&gt; default behavior so it &lt;strong&gt;does not silently override&lt;/strong&gt; existing &lt;code&gt;max_tokens&lt;/code&gt; unle</ns0:content>
